            "action_name": {
              "value": "Inhabit Vessel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe cub touches and melds with its bonded vessel, bringing the statue to life. It can cease Inhabiting its Vessel by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While Inhabiting the Vessel, it loses its fly Speed and gains Immunities healing, nonlethal; Resistances physical 3 (except bludgeoning); Speed 20 feet; and the following Strike.\n\n- **Melee** 1A jaws +10 (agile), Damage 1d6+5 bludgeoning plus Grab"
